---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL; // e.g. "/emoria/"
---

<Base lang="en" title="About EMORIA" current="About EMORIA"
  description="EMORIA develops scientifically grounded educational tools for emotional education. Our first product: Yubuu's Feeling Wheel.">
  <article class="bg-[var(--color-cream)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-14 pt-36 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-brand)]">✦ About EMORIA</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl sm:text-6xl">About EMORIA</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-6 px-6 pb-20 text-lg text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">
      <p>EMORIA develops scientifically grounded educational tools for emotional education. Our first product, Yubuu's Feeling Wheel, accompanies children aged four to ten as they recognise and name feelings and understand what lies behind them. At the centre is Yubuu, a curious being who never judges, but asks and listens.</p>

      <img src={`${base}img/yubuu-spaceship.png`} alt="Yubuu travels through the universe" loading="lazy"
        class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md rounded-[1.75rem] shadow-[var(--shadow-lift)]" />

      <p>Yubuu's Feeling Wheel is only the beginning. EMORIA continues to grow as a universe, with the aim that emotional education becomes as natural as reading and arithmetic.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-center">
      <img src={`${base}img/yubuu-asteroid.png`} alt="Yubuu" class="mx-auto mb-4 h-28 w-auto drop-shadow-[0_14px_20px_rgba(43,42,40,0.16)]" />
      <h2 class="text-3xl">Bring EMORIA to your kindergarten</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-lg text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">If your kindergarten or practice would like to be one of the first to try EMORIA, Cemil would be glad to talk to you.</p>
      <a href={`${base}en/contact`} class="mt-7 inline-block rounded-[var(--radius-pill)] bg-[var(--color-brand)] px-8 py-3.5 font-[var(--font-body)] font-semibold text-white shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--color-brand-deep)]">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
